  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.03 “Acquiring account” means the account of the participant in an allowance transfer who obtains allowances through purchase, trade, or gift, or at auction.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.03); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
